      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON COMMANDER (8) was prominent early from the tricky draw and stalked the lead but levelled up to score (23.87) at this track in Restricted WIN over 425m. Looks the one to beat. AMRON TOMMY (3) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in five starts, including two wins and three placings. In the money last time at this track (28.54) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5, finishing a long neck third. Can hit the frame with the right run. GREYSYND BONNIE (6) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when second (29.94) at Sandown. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Expected to be in this for a long way. CONCEIVABLE (7) cannot be underestimated.",
